[{"title":"水调歌头 建炎庚戌题吴江","author":"无名氏","text":"平生太湖上，短棹几经过。\n如今重到，何事愁与水云多。\n拟把匣中长剑，换取扁舟一叶，归去老渔蓑。\n银艾非吾事，丘壑已蹉跎。\n脍新鲈，斟美酒，起悲歌。\n太平生长，岂谓今日识兵戈。\n欲泻三江雪浪，净洗胡尘千里，不用挽天河。\n回首望霄汉，双泪堕清波。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":425,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 寿周相子正月初一","author":"无名氏","text":"雪霁万山出，和气蔼王正。\n平园春事竞起，梅柳冻全醒。\n此际朝元归路，疑有真仙呈瑞，笙鹤九霄声。\n东阁识风度，南极粲光明。\n看精神，秋夜月，玉壶冰。\n淳熙相业隆盛，家自得仪刑。\n闻道君王神武，捷报胡儿宵遁，玉殿正论兵。\n行奉紫泥诏，帷幄佐中兴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":426,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 寿史相七月廿九","author":"无名氏","text":"两只补天手，一片济时心。\n信道相门再相，现此宰官身。\n涤洗乾坤都了，填压华戎既定，治世庆升平。\n中外为冠冕，闻望耸簪缨。\n星昴降，蓬矢挂，属芳辰。\n黄阁一秋来早，明日又三旬。\n庭戏莱衣双桂，砌列谢兰无数，廊庙会风云。\n愿衍庄椿算，长沛傅岩霖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":427,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 寿徐枢七月十二","author":"无名氏","text":"称彼兕觥后，三日是中元。\n地官较善，龙章玉佩压仙班。\n自是德星孕秀，直与寿星争耀，茨福正绵绵。\n堂已富金玉，屣踪视王官。\n趣清闲，心洒落，在花间。\n桃培万岁，千年仙种又栽莲。\n静对秋香菊耐，长共岁寒松老，生意满西园。\n待看椿同桂，洗馥迈燕山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":428,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 庆史守正月初四","author":"无名氏","text":"一札自天下，五马为民来。\n潜藩久须重镇，帝命出蓬莱。\n曾侍九重笔橐，暂剖一州符竹，人谓屈公材。\n儒术要扬历，玉业待规恢。\n庆三元，才四日，寿筵开。\n夜深仰视霄汉，南极映星台。\n休说石家父子，休说窦家昆季，乔木即三槐。\n归觐玉皇案，馀事付盐梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":429,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 庆龙图八月十三","author":"无名氏","text":"八月秋欲半，后夜月将圆。\n天潢当日流润，馀派落人寰。\n尘扫长淮千里，威振南蛮八郡，梓里绣衣还。\n芳毓燕山桂，庆衍谢庭兰。\n小山阴，长松下，白云间。\n壶中自有天地，闻早挂蓬冠。\n笑指横空丹壑。\n闲倚拿云竹杖，佳处日跻攀。\n山色既无尽，公寿亦如山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":430,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水晶帘/南歌子 上定齐六月廿七","author":"无名氏","text":"谁道秋期远，正旬浃、双星相见。\n雨足西帘，正玉井莲开，寿筵初展。\n麈尾呼风袢暑净，那更著、纶巾羽扇。\n殢清歌，不记杯行，任深任浅。\n湖边小池苑。\n渐苔痕竹色，青青如染。\n辨橘中荷屋，晚芳自占。\n蜗角虚名身外事，付骰子、纷纷戏选。\n喜时平、公道开明，话头正转。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":431,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"无名氏","text":"晴也行。\n雨也行。\n雨也行时不似晴。\n天晴终快人。\n名也成。\n利也成。\n利也成时不似名。\n名成天下惊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":432,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"无名氏","text":"绣停针。\n泪盈盈。\n断肠梁燕语声频。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":433,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长相思 其三","author":"无名氏","text":"雨如丝。\n柳如丝。\n织出春来一段奇。\n莺梭来往飞。\n酒如池。\n醉如泥。\n遮莫教人有醒时。\n雨晴都不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":434,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长相思 其二","author":"无名氏","text":"云垂垂。\n雨霏霏。\n只恐今年花事迟。\n不然孤负伊。\n燕飞飞。\n柳依依。\n有个人人倚翠扉。\n深攒双黛眉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":435,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"无名氏","text":"花满枝。\n柳满枝。\n眼底春光似旧时。\n燕归人未归。\n泪沾衣。\n酒沾衣。\n烦恼长多欢事稀。\n此情风月知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":436,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"无名氏","text":"去年秋，今年秋，湖上人家乐复忧。\n西湖依旧流。\n吴循州，贾循州，十五年前一转头。\n人生放下休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":437,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长相思 其一","author":"无名氏","text":"不思量。\n又思量。\n一点寒灯耿夜光。\n鸳衾闲半床。\n雨声长，漏声长。\n几阵斜风摇纸窗。\n如何不断肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":438,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"相思引 贺生子、其弟又新婚","author":"无名氏","text":"潇洒江梅春早处，天然一种两般奇。\n开花结子，何事恰同时。\n昨夜北枝开雪里，朝来青子又南枝。\n这般好事，消得付新词。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":439,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长相思 其四","author":"无名氏","text":"燕成双。\n蝶成双。\n飞去飞来杨柳旁。\n问伊因底忙。\n绿纱窗，篆炉香。\n午梦惊回书满床。\n棋声春昼长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":440,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"风入松 寿刘倅九月初九","author":"无名氏","text":"晓来凉气满芙蓉。\n日到竹阴东。\n称觞歌袖三千指，屏星畔、绕绿围红。\n茱糁百杯秋色，桂华十里西风。\n生朝对饮菊花丛。\n九日一樽同。\n文章歆向家声旧，便应去、黄阁从容。\n唤起仙翁为寿，种成千岁椿松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":441,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"风中柳令/谢池春","author":"无名氏","text":"爱鬓云长，惜眉山，寻乍相见，一时眠起。\n为伊尚验，未欲将言相戏。\n早樽前、会人深意。\n霎时间阻，眼儿早巴巴地。\n便也解、封题相寄。\n怎生是款曲，终成连理。\n管胜如、旧来识底。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":442,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"风光好","author":"无名氏","text":"柳阴阴。\n水深深。\n风约双凫不自禁。\n碧波心。\n孤村桥断人迷路。\n舟横渡。\n旋买村醪浅浅斟。\n更微吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":443,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"风流子","author":"无名氏","text":"淑景皇州满，和风渐、催促柳花飞。\n过清明骤雨，五侯台榭，青烟散入，新火开时。\n绣帘外、傍人飞燕子，映叶语黄鹂。\n秋千昼永，绮罗人散，花阴笑隔，红粉墙低。\n青门多行乐，寻芳处、何计强逐轻肥。\n空对旧游满目，谁共开眉。\n遇有时系马，垂杨影下，风前伫立，惆怅佳期。\n回望故园桃李，应待人归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":444,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东风第一枝 其一","author":"无名氏","text":"腊雪犹凝，东风递暖，江南梅早先拆。\n一枝经晓芬芳，几处漏春信息。\n孤根寒艳，料化工、别施恩力。\n迥不与、桃李争妍，自称寿阳妆饰。\n雪烂熳、怨蝶未知，嗟燕孤、画楼绮陌。\n暗香空写银笺，素艳谩传妙笔。\n王孙轻顾，便好与、移栽京国。\n更免逐、羌管凋零，冷落暮山寒驿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":445,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东风第一枝 其二","author":"无名氏","text":"溪侧风回，前村雾散，寒梅一枝初绽。\n雪艳凝酥，冰肌莹玉，嫩条细软。\n歌台舞榭，似万斛、珠玑飘散。\n异众芳，独占东风，第一点装琼苑。\n青萼点、绛唇疏影，潇洒喷、紫檀龙麝。\n也知青女娇羞，寿阳懒匀粉面。\n江梅腊尽，武陵人、应知春晚。\n最苦是，皎月临风，画楼一声羌管。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":446,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东坡引 寿余倅","author":"无名氏","text":"人物伊周样。\n清政龚黄状。\n平分风月双溪上。\n红颜方少壮。\n红颜方少壮。\n生贤令节，满觞摇漾。\n红袖舞，青蛾唱。\n我来祝寿无他望。\n相门重拜相。\n相门重拜相。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":447,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"击梧桐","author":"无名氏","text":"雪叶红凋，烟林翠减，独有寒梅难并。\n瑞雪香肌，碎玉奇姿，迥得佳人风韵。\n清标暗折芳心，又是轻泄，江南春信。\n最好山前水畔，幽闲自有，横斜疏影。\n尽日凭阑，寻思无语，可惜飘琼飞粉。\n但怅望、王孙未赏，空使清香成阵。\n怎得移根帝苑，开时不许众芳近。\n免教向、深岩暗谷，结成千万恨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":448,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古记/如梦令 其三","author":"无名氏","text":"疑是水晶宫殿。\n云女天仙宝宴。\n吟赏欲黄昏，风送一声羌管。\n烟淡。\n霜淡。\n月在画楼西畔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":449,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古记/如梦令 其二","author":"无名氏","text":"腊半雪梅初绽。\n玉屑琼英碎剪。\n素艳与清香，别有风流堪羡。\n苞嫩。\n蕊嫩。\n羞破寿阳人面。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":450,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古记/如梦令 其一","author":"无名氏","text":"一枕恹恹春困。\n记得小梅风韵。\n何处最关情，嫩蕊初传芳信。\n堪恨。\n堪恨。\n谁傍横斜疏影。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":451,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名 其三","author":"无名氏","text":"捏个牛儿体态。\n按年令，旋拖五彩。\n鼓乐相迎，红裙捧拥，表一个、胜春节届。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":452,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"明年此□，□知谁健，且尽黄花酒。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":453,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"杨花飞絮。\n搅乱少年情绪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":454,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"汉宫梳罢女真妆，望金仙、朝朝暮暮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":455,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"帝里元宵风光好，胜仙岛蓬莱。\n玉动飞尘，车喝绣毂，月照楼台。\n三官此夕欢谐。\n金莲万盏，撒向天街。\n讶鼓通宵，花灯竟起，五夜齐开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":456,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"闻道酒肠宽似海。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":457,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名 其一 古木犀词","author":"无名氏","text":"费尽骚人词与诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":458,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"纱窗晓色朦胧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":459,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"愁厌厌、脉脉上心谁消遣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":460,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"恐将脂粉均妆面，羞被狂毫抹污来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":461,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"别是一般春色好。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":462,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木兰花 其六","author":"无名氏","text":"况今宵好景，金吾不禁，玉漏休催。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":463,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"淡红衫，缕金裙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":464,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"王孙去后多芳草。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":465,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"烛暗时酒醒，原来又是梦里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":466,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"芳草绿如茵，与蓝袍、草争翠色。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":467,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"登楼欲认经由处，无奈云山遮望眼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":468,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"独倚阑干十二。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":469,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名 其一 古柳词","author":"无名氏","text":"柳丝柔无力。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":470,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"月宫仙桂、被嫦娥试手，移来山谷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":471,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"旋酌菖蒲酒，灵气满芳尊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":472,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"曾教入夜月添白。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":473,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"有个秀才姓汪。\n住在祁门下乡。\n行第排来四八，做尽万千趋锵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":474,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"愁烟恨粉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":475,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"湖腻烟光，柳垂新绿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":476,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"碧玉堂前金粟斗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":477,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"燕子重来寻旧巢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":478,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名 其二 古鞦韆词","author":"无名氏","text":"但入新年，愿百事、皆如意。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":479,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"海棠著雨透胭脂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":480,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"西风渐冷，园林万木凋黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":481,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名 其二","author":"无名氏","text":"饮尽莫留残。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":482,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"料如今，甘心海角天涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":483,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"无名氏","text":"轻盈照路旁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":484,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa